{\rtf\ansi \deff0{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue128;}{\fonttbl{\f0
\fcharset0\fnil Arial;}}\plain\cf1\fs20 \pard By making repeated runs 
of this collection of statements, we can get an idea of the number of 
trials, NT, that must be averaged to get an estimate MSE1 of the 
ensemble average with low variabiblity. Then, making runs with 
different Ms, it is not difficult to find the best M for any specified 
variance of the noise.}
.TXT 11 0 227 0 0
